@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
allowmixing
title Proposed — Allowed layers and forbidden bypasses
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

rectangle "Transport / current request context" as T
rectangle "Owner application / public use case" as A
rectangle "Owner domain invariants" as D
interface "Required capability abstraction" as P
rectangle "Infrastructure adapter" as I
database "Other owner's private tables" as X
T --> A : allowed
A --> D : allowed
A --> P : allowed
I ..|> P : realizes abstraction
D -[#red,dashed]-> T : forbidden transport dependence
A -[#red,dashed]-> X : forbidden direct mutation
note bottom of I
 Solid arrows: source dependency / use.
 Hollow triangle: realization.
 Red dashed: prohibited example, not observed code.
end note

@enduml